{
  "readme": [
    "TASK-693 §4.1 — the SINGLE source of truth for the buildable service inventory.",
    "",
    "Before this file, the same list was hand-maintained in five places: the build-*",
    "job set in .gitlab/ci/build.yml, the SERVICES= line in .gitlab/ci/promote.sh,",
    "the scan-* jobs in scan.yml, the sbom-*/sign-* jobs in publish.yml, and",
    "SERVICE_TAG_PREFIXES in packages/utils/src/version-grammar.ts. A service added",
    "to four of the five is a silent partial deployment.",
    "",
    "tests/contracts/services-manifest.contract.test.ts enforces agreement between",
    "this file, build.yml, promote.sh and version-grammar.ts. It fails on drift in",
    "EITHER direction — an entry here with no build job, and a build job with no",
    "entry here.",
    "",
    "JSON has no comments, which is why this key exists. Consumers read `.services`.",
    "",
    "FIELD CONTRACT",
    "  name          Image repository name. MUST equal the build job's SERVICE_NAME,",
    "                the promote.sh SERVICES token, and the kustomize `hope-v2/<name>`",
    "                image key in the deployment repo. Three systems, one string.",
    "  tagPrefixes   Release-tag prefixes that build this image, EXCLUDING 'ALL'.",
    "                'ALL' is implicit everywhere (the platform train builds all),",
    "                so listing it is rejected by the contract test. An empty array",
    "                means ALL-only — the image has no release tag family of its own.",
    "  dockerfile    Repo-relative path.",
    "  context       Docker build context, repo-relative.",
    "  target        --target stage, or null for the final stage.",
    "  pythonBase    true => needs hope-python-base built first, and the workflow",
    "                injects --build-arg BASE_IMAGE.",
    "  promotable    true => appears in promote.sh SERVICES and is pinned into the",
    "                deployment overlay. hope-python-base is false: it is a",
    "                build-time base image and is never deployed.",
    "  platforms     What CI builds TODAY, deliberately not what TASK-690 P4 intends.",
    "                A manifest that lies about the present is worse than one silent",
    "                about the future. P4 edits this field; nothing else reads intent.",
    "  paths         Change-filter globs. Ported from the .rules-* anchors in",
    "                .gitlab/ci/rules.yml, plus two corrections noted per entry."
  ],
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "hope-python-base",
      "tagPrefixes": ["GUARD", "HARNESS", "NLP", "SMR", "STT", "TTS"],
      "dockerfile": "infrastructure/docker/python-base/Dockerfile",
      "context": "infrastructure/docker/python-base/",
      "target": null,
      "pythonBase": false,
      "promotable": false,
      "platforms": ["linux/amd64"],
      "paths": ["infrastructure/docker/python-base/**"]
    },
    {
      "name": "api",
      "tagPrefixes": ["API"],
      "dockerfile": "apps/api/Dockerfile",
      "context": ".",
      "target": null,
      "pythonBase": false,
      "promotable": true,
      "platforms": ["linux/amd64"],
      "paths": [
        "apps/api/**",
        "packages/database/**",
        "packages/domains/**",
        "packages/applications/**",
        "packages/exceptions/**",
        "packages/logger/**",
        "packages/tools/**",
        "packages/types/**",
        "packages/utils/**",
        "packages/config-eslint/**",
        "packages/config-rollup/**",
        "packages/config-ts/**",
        "apps/api/Dockerfile",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "admin-console",
      "tagPrefixes": ["ADMIN"],
      "dockerfile": "apps/admin-console/Dockerfile",
      "context": ".",
      "target": null,
      "pythonBase": false,
      "promotable": true,
      "platforms": ["linux/amd64"],
      "buildArgs": { "NEXT_PUBLIC_API_HOST": "env:NEXT_PUBLIC_API_HOST" },
      "paths": [
